  "steps": [
    "Dry roast the coconut and sesame seeds until golden and set aside.",
    "Fry one sliced onion in 1 tbsp of the oil until dark brown, then grind it with the coconut and sesame to a paste with a little water.",
    "Heat the remaining oil and cook the remaining onions until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste.",
    "Add the tomatoes, turmeric, Kolhapuri masala and salt and cook until the oil rises.",
    "Add the chicken and sear for 5 minutes, then stir in the ground paste.",
    "Add the water, cover and simmer for 25 minutes until the chicken is tender and the gravy is thick.",
    "Finish with the coriander leaves."
  ]
